    "totalDuration": "1 yr 4 mos",
    "description": "Discovered through my work on Cloud Play for Google Music, I was recruited by the CEO to become part of a team developing a next generation headphone. My work helped drive the company from the early stages of R&D to nearly full production.\n\n• Developed a multi-threaded iOS application to integrate with hardware devices via BLE and interfaced with various RESTful APIs.\n• Worked closely with the design team to enhance and build the UI to spec.\n• Provided debugging assistance to both hardware and cloud teams by creating python scripts.",
