      "month": 9,
      "year": 2015
     }
    },
    "totalDuration": "2 yrs 10 mos",
    "description": "I conceptualized and constructed a Google Music iOS application by analyzing Google’s online API calls. This allowed users to login securely and seamlessly stream their music libraries.\n\n• Because of an intuitive interface, remarkable speed and excellent stability, my app consistently showed a 4.5 star rating and rocketed to the top 10 in paid music apps on the App Store.\n• I utilized CoreData to store over 20,000 songs, albums and artists from the user’s library.\n• I took advantage of GCD, buffers and CoreAudio to provide an equalizer in the music player.",
